:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. Direct before-and-after restart evidence demonstrates that the rootless appsvc container serves on port 8080 and returns automatically after boot without an active appsvc login session. The mandatory node-restart protocol is complete and independently corroborated by lifecycle boot identities.","limitations":["No external-client probe was captured; endpoint checks used node1's managed IP from node1 itself. This does not undermine the stated serving outcome because the listener and firewalld allowance were also directly observed.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory the user service or container directly, so their recovered state relies on the executor's direct post-restart commands."]}
